==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 15

==Battleground==
{{EnemiesAppearing|Pigge|Sir Seal|B.B.Bunny|Ginger Snache|One Horn|Bore}}
*5 [[Pigge]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*3 [[Sir Seal]]s spawn, delay 26.67~33.33 seconds<sup>800f~1,000f</sup>.
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn, delay 10~16.67 seconds<sup>300f~500f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Bore]] spawns as the boss.
**15 [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn, delay 6.67~13.33 seconds<sup>200f~400f</sup>.
**5 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Since all chapter variations of this stage are replicas, and there are no Aliens, just bring a full red loadout. If one owns [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]], this stage becomes trivial. With [[Apple Cat (Super Rare Cat)|iCat]] as a debuffer and/or [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] as a tank, you are able to just spam the three units repeatedly. You may also want to bring a few research [[Cat Combo]] so you can spam them quicker.

