==Trivia==
*In all chapters, Plumpit is the only Cats of the Cosmos stage not to contain any [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Aliens]].
**Additionally, this is one of the only Cats of the Cosmos stages to have the same exact enemy lineup across all chapters.
**The fact that all enemies are [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] could be due to how plum pits are also red, in a similar way as how [[Red Rectangle (Cats of the Cosmos)|Red Rectangle]] has mainly Red enemies.
*Plumpit's Japanese name, Ume Boshi, is a pun on [[wikipedia:Umeboshi|umeboshi]], a salt-dried or pickled [[wikipedia:Ume|''ume'']] fruit. The joke is that the stage is spelled as ウメ星, meaning "Ume Star", instead of 梅干し.
*In [[The Battle Cats POP!]] this stage is called Plumstar.

